{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/qy1vt43bp7wn21yel117vgm6fi2ia5i.mp3","text":"博士，需要我帮忙搬什么东西吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/j5guzy9jtysrrk02kwmnpqbenpu0ity.mp3","text":"这个吵闹的金属乐声......能天使姐又在自顾自开派对了。博士，要不要我去提醒她一下？","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/jq49834cwfpoz5o6htqkoss7z8z5ha1.mp3","text":"体力活的话，我很擅长。公司经营方面的事务，我也懂一些。所以，博士，有什么我能派上用场的地方吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/31/bd92ladsrz07mk3r6iwcou70ozqr8cw.mp3","text":"因为父亲这一代在龙门扎根，我其实是土生土长的龙门人......博士你要是想了解龙门的话，我倒是可以帮上忙。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/44/7lpyizl9yxtqxsoef7rsgve3l74otjy.mp3","text":"博士，想知道正规物流公司的运作方式的话，直接来问我比较好。企鹅物流是个特例，毫无恶意地说，他们应该没有任何参考价值......","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/nubvhmqwzi2ccyzkaghit49w2g1mh3u.mp3","text":"任务之外的安排？一般除了休息，就是陪可颂姐逛街吧，我要负责帮她提东西，还要制止她乱花钱......博士也想一起来吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/shlck8btunxqjihoidsznnevmldvpkk.mp3","text":"我过去一直认为，对任何公司来说，规范的流程和高效的执行才是能让它长久运转的关键。所以最开始的时候，我非常不理解，为什么企鹅物流这样的公司能够存续下来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/o6l4estxqrwzoi7ycgrwqy4syveyjr8.mp3","text":"和企鹅物流的人接触了以后，和几位姐姐们的相处让我明白了一件事——这个世界，比我想的要宽广许多。条理与规则没有错，但它不适用于所有人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/5lwb4t1sep1v2c0c25o0vvhi4eo451o.mp3","text":"博士，或许你自己没有发现，但是，能让那么多个性迥异的人都信服你，其实是一件非常不简单的事......要是有一天，我也能变得像博士你一样就好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/7vjx5xsinmg5bdy759s54pduz1k0m8c.mp3","text":"博士......唔，在休息吗，那我先打扫一下卫生吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/cmejre0lrrcmcvevmojij8iiqgw4v3g.mp3","text":"初次见面，博士，我是拜松。按照合约内容，接下来我也会作为罗德岛的一员行动，请多指教。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/ccz6qevdfhpfsagumko54aozc2bk1o4.mp3","text":"谢谢，我会好好学习的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/39/6v943penpchdw33ua3l3twkp5dwp0xf.mp3","text":"谢谢，博士。只要脚踏实地，总会有所收获，这是我的信条。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/l5b68n3ewumw2kgrv91qbf25rwm7898.mp3","text":"在企鹅物流和罗德岛，我看到了更宽广的世界......博士，总有一天，我也会在这个世界里找到属于自己的位置。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/cbnqh1rst39x3nqmaecr77fw2hd8aeq.mp3","text":"要执行任务吗？我了解了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:5/50/tk411ghnt6e0prry0rztb7q6pr9846y.mp3","text":"现场指挥的话......我稍微有些经验。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/8cmjxy2e9mh4fi2h8ejmls4c0dwg81a.mp3","text":"嗯，任务地点和任务目标我都好好记住了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/8v8v4v3ljtc3kc92675j68ptyqkxddt.mp3","text":"呼......我不会给大家拖后腿的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:4/47/hip1ypgn0z2mbm7bbpcvq1jrhwtz0wh.mp3","text":"我该怎么做，博士？","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/eg652sqe0smdgrse79owqbtp8t32r83.mp3","text":"到我了吗，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/tcbf54zcm2l1mutryos3fcqgxnw0arx.mp3","text":"我会努力的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/infl1u7fl7jodudrown10rfyndbxvpv.mp3","text":"我知道了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/cmaswnayukx8q0ylr0hrqc088byhr96.mp3","text":"我还坚持得住。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/05/hcf1vxg4r7wfrsaokukrh7z0h9oo3qd.mp3","text":"再坚持一下吗？我知道了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/77/ng0kailakg3phzefz0boje1hgdibx6z.mp3","text":"请放心，我的盾还是很坚固的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_027.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/mllb6iyb05yrv2fvq1ku3tam2oyi6vs.mp3","text":"博士......你要是转业的话，一定是每家公司都想要的那种管理人才。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/c3pfugyevuxbmc9kdynskzjmmgz3dgj.mp3","text":"博士......果然很厉害。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/oa8cchpelvly2kw9ds6p8npkvjanzez.mp3","text":"任务的基础目标已经达成了，这样就可以了吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/3e1l0nx03tq2njs8vh6uxs0cyjeuhg6.mp3","text":"博士，不要泄气，我们还有机会。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:0/09/tctkx29fjdu4dp3pjpze68pio7j5yzl.mp3","text":"罗德岛里面......真大。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/l45pnhm24y36bqmjvcsgxue5apivvl3.mp3","text":"要我去哪里？","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/hjds92oxyw76j66o7qr0pzjfxmfeej4.mp3","text":"空姐的新专辑......真好听。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/nt57unuegcy0ukkx363s2ugxw27eqbx.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/ldn44y1tgfwp6uans2spk13gq0p5aeg.mp3","text":"新年到了，我谨代表峯驰物流向罗德岛送上新年贺帖。恭祝罗德岛全体员工在新的一年诸事顺利，平安健康。然后，这个是我自己送给博士的贺卡，祝您新年快乐。今年也要请您继续指教了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/me7qttr2rojcz2del9offozvbjiixen.mp3","text":"早上好，博士！","alt":"voice_cn/char_325_bison/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/14/sp2wkn5u2oehggrqwad1xgv044s5ji1.mp3","text":"博士，需要我帮忙搬什么东西吗？","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/p5k04k6jkaawox51wxeo35vl2spu8bi.mp3","text":"这个吵闹的金属乐声......能天使姐又在自顾自开派对了。博士，要不要我去提醒她一下？","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/15/ky8aqk2yi2cvi81madjnhecd5huqe8l.mp3","text":"体力活的话，我很擅长。公司经营方面的事务，我也懂一些。所以，博士，有什么我能派上用场的地方吗？","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/73/t3dzm4bv465dvvu8jlchnbegmee1ug4.mp3","text":"因为父亲这一代在龙门扎根，我其实是土生土长的龙门人......博士你要是想了解龙门的话，我倒是可以帮上忙。","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/eglt3m0omahchypfh9ty1a33a53zy16.mp3","text":"博士，想知道正规物流公司的运作方式的话，直接来问我比较好。企鹅物流是个特例，毫无恶意地说，他们应该没有任何参考价值......","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/hg95cnr26xyois0b8hbbok9ffc0kvud.mp3","text":"任务之外的安排？一般除了休息，就是陪可颂姐逛街吧，我要负责帮她提东西，还要制止她乱花钱......博士也想一起来吗？","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/4co55nz4f8fu3yn0h9fd67co1l0u1z3.mp3","text":"我过去一直认为，对任何公司来说，规范的流程和高效的执行才是能让它长久运转的关键。所以最开始的时候，我非常不理解，为什么企鹅物流这样的公司能够存续下来。","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/5oco8kfiz060zekxkp6zlvq9l395dis.mp3","text":"和企鹅物流的人接触了以后，和几位姐姐们的相处让我明白了一件事——这个世界，比我想的要宽广许多。条理与规则没有错，但它不适用于所有人。","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/25/n35oordv0seyx8c8gzwf6qh0mk6ya1s.mp3","text":"博士，或许你自己没有发现，但是，能让那么多个性迥异的人都信服你，其实是一件非常不简单的事......要是有一天，我也能变得像博士你一样就好了。","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/7q8anbgje2hagjp5ltwqdkjen91t3be.mp3","text":"博士......唔，在休息吗，那我先打扫一下卫生吧。","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/clxrjwawcq0tt83mvfx9rk1q32xk6gk.mp3","text":"初次见面，博士，我是拜松。按照合约内容，接下来我也会作为罗德岛的一员行动，请多指教。","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/31/aec69183yyvo0004oamj8tldif2xq5h.mp3","text":"谢谢，我会好好学习的。","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:7/77/kycatevfyt67ca62fdedmt1af6b2y1i.mp3","text":"谢谢，博士。只要脚踏实地，总会有所收获，这是我的信条。","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/r4qziq8h1i2ickdd4rfaad5uxde9gqf.mp3","text":"在企鹅物流和罗德岛，我看到了更宽广的世界......博士，总有一天，我也会在这个世界里找到属于自己的位置。","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/oeziu9qagifzxn3c3km72nsaiti4l1h.mp3","text":"要执行任务吗？我了解了。","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/ga8fda1bou2uuyzbv6ga3tlutzpppd2.mp3","text":"现场指挥的话......我稍微有些经验。","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:8/86/cglmr54kv833560un2qwbanqdzzgoic.mp3","text":"嗯，任务地点和任务目标我都好好记住了。","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/8son1jgdsq6fhg1ehi6y3yf5ze2bk4f.mp3","text":"呼......我不会给大家拖后腿的。","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/hil6ldj9pa25tltczcd3qbgdmbqqxi7.mp3","text":"我该怎么做，博士？","alt":"voice/char_325_bison/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/50/q1srdei5acv2kxl4d5n9ohmelu9gojs.mp3","text"